  "content": "![隨機生物尺寸](https://i.ibb.co/MfbDTCK/random-mob-sizes-banner.png)  \n<br>\n<h3>讓您可以設定生物以不同尺寸生成</h3>\n\n<br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nRZZ43X/divider-dark-green.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n\n根據設定，生物將會以隨機尺寸生成。<br>\n查看[維基](https://github.com/tristankechlo/RandomMobSizes/wiki)以獲取更多關於如何設定此模組的資訊。\n\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nRZZ43X/divider-dark-green.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"><br><br>  \n\n如果您對這個模組有任何疑問，或者想了解即將推出的功能：\n<br>\n歡迎加入 Discord &nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a title=\"discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\" />\n</a>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a title=\"discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">連結</a>",
